---
description: Server-side rules for API routes, server actions, and services
globs:
  - "app/api/**"
  - "src/server/**"
  - "src/application/**"
alwaysApply: false
---
- Validate every external input at the boundary.
- Derive user identity server-side.
- Enforce authorization before loading/modifying protected resources.
- Enforce permission immediately before high-impact actions.
- Use domain commands rather than arbitrary persistence writes.
- Never return service-role credentials or secret values.
- Map infrastructure errors to stable application errors.
- Emit correlation IDs.
